Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 指导 - 请说 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coach. - Yes, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.03,0:00:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去哪 - 前往中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where do I go? - Proceed to the hub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.41,0:00:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么知道哪个是他 - 是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How will I know who he is? - This is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.41,0:01:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 叉子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Fork.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾米 - 不不 我不叫叉子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amy. - No, no, my name's not fork.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.51,0:01:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 就是… - 我叫弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I guessed. It was just… - It's Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.66,0:01:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要坐下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna sit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.49,0:01:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们坐下吗 - 要不只能站着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall we sit? - I think it's that or stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.57,0:01:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come sit, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.27,0:01:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…坐那边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, um… I was on that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.49,0:01:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我… - 不不 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall I…? - No, no, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:01:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是多嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why bring it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.03,0:02:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我太紧张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I'm so bloody nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次使用…系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my first time on the, you know, the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也是 - 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me too. - Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.81,0:02:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我要吓尿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm shitting it, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.46,0:02:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说起来 你看上去是吓坏了 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come to mention it, you look terrified. - Do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 怕得打颤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, quaking with fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是因为反感而颤抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe shaking with revulsion?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你不…尿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you stopped… shitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别再谈尿了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we stop talking about shitting?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.48,0:02:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,点个餐什么的 好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe order some food? Good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.47,0:02:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道我们怎么点吗 - 应该是用这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know how we order? - I think we use these.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,菜单已经订好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Menu choice already established.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请慢用 先生 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here you are, sir. - Ta.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有您的 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for you, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 我喜欢意大利面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, evidently I'm a pasta girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.69,0:02:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm a, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼饼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…fishcake…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挺好吃的 - 我能尝尝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's good. - Can I try some?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样 可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we… allowed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.73,0:03:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.09,0:03:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 管他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们都是第一次的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… we're both first-timers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们的有效期吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we check our expiry date?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.66,0:03:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好主意 - 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, good plan. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.47,0:03:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 应该是在「信息」里看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, um, so I think it's under "info."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 「按下显示」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, "tap to reveal."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.57,0:03:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得同时按\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to tap to reveal at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那么 倒数 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. So, on three,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 一 按下\N{\fnArial\fs30}two, one. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 12小时 - 是啊 12小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Twelve hours. - Yeah, 12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 有点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. - Bit, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.39,0:03:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 有点短\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Bit short.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有点短 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a bit short, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.07,0:03:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还越来越短了 我不知道它还…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And getting shorter. I didn't realize it would…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还这样倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}sort of count down like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好悲哀啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sort of sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.03,0:03:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们该快点吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should eat quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 你说得对 - 比赛开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Yeah, maybe we should. - The race is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.29,0:04:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.69,0:04:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess this is us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这带我们去那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this takes us to the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.83,0:04:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.60,0:04:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你先请 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们到了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here we are. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.17,0:05:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想来开吗 还是我来 - 你来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you wanna open it or shall I? - You go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.55,0:05:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,太慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.74,0:05:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a knob.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 里面好烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. It's a shithole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.51,0:05:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你开玩笑的吧 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're kidding. - I am, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊 我喜欢这灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice. I, uh, like that lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 那灯真不错 - 少来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, it's incredible, that lamp. - Fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.84,0:06:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有套件\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an en suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 淋浴还是浴盆 - 都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shower or bath? - Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.61,0:06:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用下厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm… I'm just gonna use the loo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我也得…在这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've got to, uh… over here, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.05,0:06:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 说真的 我们该做什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, seriously, what are we meant to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题太宽泛 请缩小范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Query too broad. Please narrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, are we just meant to…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,开干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, like, just go at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:06:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,请定义「开干」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Define "go at it."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.84,0:07:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是要一起做爱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, are we meant to just have sex with each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.91,0:07:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不要求参与者必须采取什么指定行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Participants are not required to take any specific action.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但我们可以这么做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I mean we can, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果时间很短 有人会这么做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, people do if it's just a short time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们决定如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这由我们决定 - 由你们决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's up to us? - It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.19,0:07:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以睡这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could just sleep here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了 那样腿都伸不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be daft. You'll be scrunched up in a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.78,0:07:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么差的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.77,0:07:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,床挺大的 我觉得咱俩都躺得下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bed's pretty big. I'm sure we could both fit in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.54,0:07:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有系统之前肯定很疯狂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have been mental before the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们还得自己去恋爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, people had to do the whole relationship thing themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞清楚自己想跟谁在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}work out who they wanna be with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择无力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Option paralysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择太多 你反而不知道自己想要什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many choices, you end up not knowing which one you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 没错 如果情况不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, exactly, and if things seem shitty,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.57,0:08:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还得考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd have to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.98,0:08:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己要不要跟人分手\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether they wanted to break up with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么跟人分手啊 老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}How to break up with someone. Fuckin' hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是噩梦 - 不像安排好了时那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just a nightmare. - It's not like when it's all mapped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是 安排好了简单多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, no. It's so much simpler when it's all mapped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但这样好怪 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is weird, though. - It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.53,0:09:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你做我的第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for being my first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很棒 你真的很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was great, you know. You were nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.19,0:09:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们还能有这个时间 你绝对能上了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we had this time again, you would totally get it, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.63,0:09:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你…坏死了 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You… You bastard. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也是 - 我们真是搞砸了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'd get it, too. - Fucked that one up, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.98,0:10:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是觉得时间那么短没什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I just don't see the point in something that short.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.97,0:10:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,才12小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对短暂邂逅的反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even your reaction to a brief encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.53,0:10:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也向系统提供了宝贵信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}provides the system with valuable information.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我什么都没做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I didn't even do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.14,0:10:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统觉得我是个假正经\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system thinks I'm a prude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统不做任何道德评判\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system makes no moral judgments.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我怎么知道她不是我的完美伴侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but how do I know she wasn't the perfect match for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she was…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的绝配尚未被选定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ultimate compatible other has not yet been selected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.06,0:10:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know, but it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统通过每位参与者与数个对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system gains insight as each participant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,交往的过程增进了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}progresses through numerous relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.74,0:10:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,并用所采集的数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}and uses the gathered data.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,来最终选定绝配\N{\fnArial\fs30}to eventually select an ultimate compatible other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在配对日 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your pairing day, I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:10:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它总能找到你的完美对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it always finds your perfect match.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:10:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在99.8%的案例中 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 99.8% of cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我得经历一大堆恋爱才能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have to go through loads of relationships to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.12,0:11:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That is correct. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 新的恋爱 - 这么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Another relationship. - What, already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.38,0:11:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 又来一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this, another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.01,0:11:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.48,0:11:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我该去换衣服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd best go get changed, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.49,0:11:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去 那是他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy fuck. Tell me that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.49,0:11:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能在个人介绍后确认身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot confirm identity until a personal introduction is made.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,身份确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identity confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.31,0:11:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢你的头发 - 你的也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like your hair. - Yours is good too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.17,0:11:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.91,0:11:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,太逗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.13,0:12:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮可拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicola.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到了有一会儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been here a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我去换衣服来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sorry. I was getting changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.35,0:12:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 你已经开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - You started already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.17,0:12:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我饿了 - 当然 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was hungry. - Yeah, course, yeah. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.53,0:12:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧的吧 看看有效期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get it over with. Checking the expiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.91,0:12:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}One year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.79,0:12:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以交往一年 是不是搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got each other for one year? Could be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.71,0:12:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 指导 是不是搞错了 - 不是搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coach, is this a mistake? - This is not a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus fucking Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.63,0:12:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:12:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.01,0:13:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想好的一面 咖喱鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look on the bright side. Chicken tikka masala.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.34,0:13:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.35,0:13:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖喱鸡 是个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicken tikka mas… It's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.74,0:13:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.35,0:13:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你还开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're the sort of person that makes jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 倒数三 - 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, so on three. - Two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.53,0:13:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.79,0:13:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,九个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.02,0:14:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我上一个差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much the same as my last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.23,0:14:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做过几次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of these have you had?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.57,0:14:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,恋爱吗 到目前 五个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relationships? So far? Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算是老手了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an old hand, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我去冲个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm just gonna jump in the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.29,0:14:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 不会要很久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. - Won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.17,0:14:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果你不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, listen, if you're OK with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我第五次恋爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is relationship five for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发觉最好是直接就开始做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've found it's best to have sex straight away upfront.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.23,0:15:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以打破尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of breaks the ice,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对匹配性有个比较早的大致了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}gives an early overview of compatibility and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我这就同意一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm consenting to everything now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.65,0:15:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候愿意也这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever you feel comfortable doing the same…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖喱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tikka masala. Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.59,0:15:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 有点咖喱味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's a bit tikka masala.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.62,0:15:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 你说话时更重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Talking makes it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.90,0:15:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 你得从后面来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, you're gonna have to do it from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 从后面来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You what? - From behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,再快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,多点动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}More motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.51,0:16:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那样 多点动作 你就进进出出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like that. More motion. You're all in out, in out,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.81,0:16:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是想关上文件柜的抽屉\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you're trying to shut a drawer into a filing cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 太无聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - It's just boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,多点横向动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want a bit more side to side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.09,0:16:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.26,0:16:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能直接退出吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can't just walk away?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它最终会为你找到绝配\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day it will provide you with the ultimate match.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终 最终\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day. One day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.15,0:18:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'd just like to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要相信系统 它能够兑现承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}do have faith in the system, because it does deliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们就是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会积累很多经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have so many experiences,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终有一天 它为你找到绝配\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then one day it pairs you up with your ultimate match,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the best in show, as it were.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.14,0:18:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有所怀疑 要坚持下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you're having doubts, just hang on in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它真的好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it really does work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒜酱汁 多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garlic dip. Thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.81,0:19:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that, uh, your…?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.43,0:19:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 妮可拉 - 妮可拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Nicola. - Oh. Nicola.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.80,0:19:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.11,0:19:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是…你真的假的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not being…? Are you being serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.27,0:19:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 还是来真的 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. OK, this is happening. OK, um, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.41,0:19:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好美 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look well. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.71,0:19:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒想也赞美你两句\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd return the compliment,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:20:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你刚把食物吐在了我鞋上\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you've just spat food on my shoe, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.61,0:20:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过老实说 那鞋很恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be fair, it is a revolting shoe, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.79,0:20:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正好用来踢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the better to kick you with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很疼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that really hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 疼啊 - 真抱歉 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ouch. - I'm so sorry. Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰尼 这是弗兰克 弗兰克 这是兰尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lenny, this is, um, Frank. Frank, this is Lenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.81,0:20:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰尼 你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Lenny. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.77,0:20:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一起过一小段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were together for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.42,0:20:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很小的一段时间 - 是啊 在我们之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A small… small bit. - Yeah, just before we…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.90,0:20:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩是…那太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you two…? Oh. That's… that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.85,0:20:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩看上去很般配\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I mean… it looks like you two make a great team.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.62,0:20:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 回见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Um, I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.51,0:20:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.08,0:22:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道你发出的那个声音 - 什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know that noise you make? - What noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.39,0:22:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.56,0:22:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的 经常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you do, quite often.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.65,0:22:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你烦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.96,0:22:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bit, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.86,0:22:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我尽量不弄了 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll try not to. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.31,0:23:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's been great, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.46,0:24:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可惜要结束了 - 但也没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shame it has to end. - But end it must.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.67,0:24:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.12,0:24:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.35,0:24:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就又有新伴侣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another partner already?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.17,0:24:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.10,0:24:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 三 二 一 按\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, three, two, one, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.79,0:24:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,36小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty-six hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.10,0:24:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh… bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.24,0:25:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.80,0:25:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.86,0:26:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想说 - 别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just wanna say… - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.50,0:26:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在知道跟我讨厌的人一起生活的滋味了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I learned what it's like to cohabit with someone I despise.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.32,0:26:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对系统有帮助吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that useful for the system?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.74,0:26:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切皆有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything happens for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.90,0:26:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我想的要快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's sooner than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.24,0:26:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.68,0:26:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没错吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.39,0:26:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.53,0:27:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到系统会让我们再约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I didn't think the system would hook us up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.59,0:27:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.00,0:27:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然希望是没搞错 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I hope it's right, obviously, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.11,0:27:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,指导 我们没坐错桌子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coach, are we sat at the right table?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.83,0:27:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没坐错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.92,0:27:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.93,0:27:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们先别看有效期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, um… Can we not check the expiry date?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.89,0:27:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 我好烦那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Just sick of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.61,0:27:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统让我一个个人地换\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system's just bounced me from bloke to bloke,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.07,0:27:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是露水情缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}short fling after short fling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.10,0:27:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那都是露水情缘 毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know they're short flings, they're just meaningless,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.27,0:27:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心不在焉 完全不在状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I get really detached. It's like I'm not really there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.82,0:27:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一周 我跟一个人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the other week, I was with this guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.11,0:27:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道是谁 就是换了张脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows who, basically just a haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.71,0:27:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真有种灵魂出窍的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I literally had this out-of-body experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.64,0:27:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的魂魄飞了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wandered out of my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.26,0:27:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在了房间对面的椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I sat in this chair across the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.80,0:27:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着自己干那男的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I watched myself fucking this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.99,0:27:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想 这怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was, like, what is that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.43,0:27:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那完全就是一根屌进进出出地插一个洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is literally just a dick going in and out of a hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.37,0:27:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是挺不走心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's pretty detached.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.76,0:27:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是长期的恋爱也一样糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it's a long-term thing, it's just as bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.83,0:27:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直像蹲监狱一样等着时间过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}watching the clock like you're a prisoner,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.28,0:27:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,每分钟 每小时地数着\N{\fnArial\fs30}counting the hours, the minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.64,0:27:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 深有体会 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God, I've been there. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.56,0:28:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 我们别看有效期了 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, let's not check the expiry, then. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.27,0:28:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说定了 - 说定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a deal. - Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.54,0:28:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.57,0:28:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,上鱼饼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring on les fishcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.13,0:28:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.00,0:28:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 - 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - So…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.17,0:28:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不如就做吧 - 我想我们必须做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Might as well. - I suppose we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.37,0:28:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道我们有多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know how much time we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.14,0:28:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是10分钟呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it could be ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.95,0:28:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得你能坚持10分钟吗 - 讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Think you could last ten minutes? - Fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.79,0:28:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. OK, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.02,0:28:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们中该有一个人先脱衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. One of us should get undressed first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.41,0:28:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么就一个 - 那样多好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why only one of us? - It'll be funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.14,0:28:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 脱裤子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on then. Get your kit off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.56,0:28:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 是我的点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, it was my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.64,0:28:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.93,0:29:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样让我好没面子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is kind of emasculating.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.50,0:29:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你待会儿可得大展雄风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, you'd better make up for it in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.29,0:29:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看你的老二\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna see your dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.01,0:29:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.87,0:29:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要看到它啦 - 行啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna fucking see it - Yeah, OK. Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.21,0:29:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是根本没有审查呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if there is no scrutiny,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.81,0:29:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是把我们随机地配对\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just putting us together in any old order,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.94,0:29:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都听之任之\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we all go along with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.15,0:29:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们总在宣传这个系统多智能\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause they're always telling us how clever it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.58,0:30:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但它能让人们找到真爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but it does put people with the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.71,0:30:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有99.8%的成功率呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got a 99.8% success rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.19,0:30:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你怎么知道他们是完美匹配的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how do you know they're perfect matches?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.60,0:30:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它其实只是在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what if all it's actually doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.51,0:30:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,渐渐消磨我们的耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gradually wearing us down,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.78,0:30:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们经历一段段的恋情\N{\fnArial\fs30}putting us in one relationship after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.25,0:30:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,以随机的顺序 时长也是随机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for random durations in a random sequence?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.98,0:30:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次 你都会变得更顺从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each time you get a little bit more pliable,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.27,0:30:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,更心碎一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little bit more broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.80,0:30:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到最终 它给出最终提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}until eventually it coughs up the final offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.21,0:30:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,并告诉你那就是完美对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}and says that's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.58,0:30:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那时 你已经太挫败 太疲惫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by that point you are so defeated and so exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.68,0:30:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你直接接受了 将就了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you just accept it, you settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.56,0:30:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 你余生都得一直\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you have to live the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.47,0:30:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说服自己 那不是将就\N{\fnArial\fs30}convincing yourself you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.31,0:30:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好 真是我听过的最阴暗的论调了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done. That's one of the bleakest things I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.18,0:30:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.74,0:30:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你想听听我的理论吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Do you wanna know my theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.16,0:30:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设系统不是随机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's assume the system isn't random.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.36,0:30:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是真如他们说的那么复杂 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's as sophisticated as they say it is. - OK.
