Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.93,0:31:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每一个疯狂的念头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every crazy thought you've ever had,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.50,0:31:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所有的梦想和弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}all your dreams and your weaknesses and…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.63,0:31:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的疯狂理论是 - 你脑海里的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And your mad theories. - Yeah, like, everything in your head.
