Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.61,0:31:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那它有思想吗 - 好吧 那么你是要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- does it have thoughts? - All right, so now you're gonna say:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.71,0:31:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,「如果那就是我们 我们困在模拟里了呢」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What if that's us and we're stuck in a simulation?"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.06,0:31:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how would we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.97,0:31:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.88,0:31:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能被编程了要喊疼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might have been programmed to go "Ow."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.78,0:31:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.01,0:31:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come here. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.16,0:33:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 指导 - 你好 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coach? - Hello, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.38,0:33:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我必须知道 - 你想知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've gotta know. - What would you like to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.98,0:33:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和艾米的有效期 我需要知道有多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}The expiry date for me and Amy. I need to know how long.
