Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.19,0:33:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望我劝你别问吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like me to talk you out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.93,0:33:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 不 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Uh… No. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.88,0:33:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.68,0:34:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不做了 我说过不做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not gonna do it. I said I wouldn't.
