Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.56,0:34:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,指导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.30,0:34:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 指导 - 重新校准\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coach. - Recalibrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.21,0:34:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,指导 怎么回事 指导 越来越短了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coach. What's happening? Coach, it's getting shorter.
