Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.59,0:34:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让有效期不稳定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has destabilized the expiry date.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.41,0:34:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新校准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recalibrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.87,0:35:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我自己看了 所以它越来越短了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I looked at it on my own, it made it shorter?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.54,0:35:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That is correct. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.64,0:35:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切皆有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything happens for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.81,0:35:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那撤销 让它倒回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, undo it, then. Make it go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.95,0:35:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 重新校准\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot do that. Recalibrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.87,0:35:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是她也看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if she looks at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.38,0:35:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦缩短 有效期就不能再延长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once shortened, the expiry date cannot be extended.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.57,0:35:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.18,0:35:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切皆有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything happens for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.84,0:35:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样 - 重新校准\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Come on. - Recalibrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.14,0:35:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它什么时候停下来 - 重新校准\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When will it stop? - It will stabilize.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.30,0:35:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束后便会稳定下来 重新校准\N{\fnArial\fs30}once recalibration has completed. Recalibrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.55,0:35:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 停下啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. Stop it. Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.96,0:36:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.54,0:36:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.65,0:36:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.86,0:36:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打出过超过四下或低于四下的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever had more than four or less than four?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.29,0:36:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.76,0:36:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.73,0:37:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 说真的 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, seriously, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.10,0:37:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.06,0:37:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looked at what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.33,0:38:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好不看的 我们还握手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We promised we wouldn't. We shook on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.71,0:38:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想知道是多少吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you wanna know what it said?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.96,0:38:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想 就是因为不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That was the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.34,0:38:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 反正也快结束了 - 差多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's almost done anyway. - How almost done?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.85,0:38:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就剩一小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got, like, an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.03,0:38:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不早点说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.09,0:38:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不想破坏气氛 - 这就不破坏了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Didn't wanna spoil today. - And this hasn't spoilt it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.44,0:38:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来是五年的 但现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was supposed to be five years, but now…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.46,0:38:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看了 结果出事了 它开始缩短\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked at it, something happened, it started going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.54,0:38:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道怎么回事 - 是你弄坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know what it was. - So you broke it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.48,0:38:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no. I mean, I don't… I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.80,0:38:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么非要看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you have to look at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.50,0:38:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 或许我们可以想办法绕过它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I was thinking maybe we could overcome it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.07,0:38:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么非要看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you have to look at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.73,0:38:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.87,0:38:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like properly, really, I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.78,0:38:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷啊 那就不够吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For fuck's sake. And that wasn't enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.91,0:38:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.76,0:38:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看了 但那不是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked, but that's not the issue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.61,0:38:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.34,0:38:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么 你对这个比对没多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck! You're more wound up about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.67,0:38:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,更生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}than how short the time is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.47,0:38:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 因为我们说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, because we had agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.95,0:39:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. Listen. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.12,0:39:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果我们不管它呢 - 我们不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What if we just ignore it? - We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.86,0:39:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我们不管系统了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we'll just fuck the system. We'll fuck it…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.93,0:39:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后呢 - 跳出去 跳到墙外面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And do what? - We'll jump out, over the wall, get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.37,0:39:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.17,0:39:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道 你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How d'you know? How d'you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.40,0:39:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾米 - 你给毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amy… - You've ruined this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.01,0:39:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've ruined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.60,0:39:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.50,0:39:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾米 - 别跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amy. - Don't follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.77,0:39:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.68,0:39:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.48,0:39:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切皆有原因 - 什么原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything happens for a reason. - What reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.81,0:39:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统将评估你对一段\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system will be assessing your reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.54,0:39:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍视感情的过早结束的反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the painful premature termination of a treasured relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.64,0:39:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,并据此改进它对\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will adjust and improve its profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.48,0:39:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终真爱的解析\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your eventual chosen one accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.00,0:39:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真会安慰人 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a great comfort. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.68,0:40:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 我现在想翻过外面那座墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God, I feel like scaling the wall out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.50,0:40:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳进荒野里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and jumping in the fucking wilderness.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.69,0:40:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会违反系统规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would contravene the rules of the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.74,0:40:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fucking system.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.12,0:40:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不遵守系统规则可能会被驱逐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Failure to comply with the system may result in banishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.48,0:40:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.52,0:40:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 你就不能让我发发火吗 不行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ, will you let me be angry at least? Will you give me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.30,0:40:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有效期截止时 你必须搬出\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must vacate your current living quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.31,0:40:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的居所\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the time expires.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.60,0:40:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像我不知道似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.18,0:42:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我没看 我们还能在一起好几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I hadn't have looked, we'd have been together years.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.03,0:42:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.57,0:42:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道当你遇到了一个人 你立刻就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know when you meet someone and you just know?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.25,0:42:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你立刻知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just know that…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.46,0:42:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在能插我了吗 我下巴都疼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reckon you could pop this in me now? I've sort of got jaw ache.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.79,0:42:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.39,0:42:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了那一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after all that,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.27,0:42:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都没道过歉 一次都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}he never even apologized, not once.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.36,0:42:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.17,0:42:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你介意我想着她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if I think about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.26,0:42:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以想着他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can think about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.57,0:42:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.05,0:43:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.91,0:43:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.14,0:43:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.57,0:43:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的绝配已经找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ultimate match has been identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.83,0:43:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的配对日是明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your pairing day is tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.74,0:43:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绝配 「真爱」吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ultimate as in "The one"? - That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.65,0:43:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们明天见面 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And we meet tomorrow? - That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.91,0:43:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天 你将与你的绝配配对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow you'll be coupled with your ultimate match.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.63,0:43:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们将一起永远离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and together you will leave this place forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.79,0:43:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.99,0:44:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以跟我说说那人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you allowed to tell me anything about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.17,0:44:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经认识那人了吗 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do I know them already? - Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.30,0:44:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样啊 - 还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - There is one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.58,0:44:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.27,0:44:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,配对日之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prior to pairing day,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.29,0:44:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以获得短暂的告别时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have been allocated a short farewell period.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.58,0:44:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对象你可以自己选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}with an individual of your choosing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.42,0:44:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,告别时间 就是我可以跟一个人告别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A farewell period? Like, I get to say goodbye to someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.18,0:44:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.73,0:44:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据显示这可以提供心理上的了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data shows this can help provide psychological closure.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.47,0:44:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 我选择弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, I choose Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.85,0:44:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的选择已经登记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your choice has been registered.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.96,0:44:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们要在哪见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Where are we meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.18,0:44:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,老地方 晚上7：30\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usual booth, 7:30 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.81,0:44:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.42,0:44:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 指导 - 艾米 请说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coach? - Yes, Amy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.76,0:44:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count to four.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.77,0:44:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.15,0:45:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们有多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. How long have we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.70,0:45:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统把我的配对日安排在了明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the system's set my pairing day for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.43,0:45:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也是 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, me too. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.09,0:45:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要系统给我选的人 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want whoever the system reckons the one is, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.70,0:45:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想要你 - 我也想要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want you. - I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.11,0:45:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不遵守系统规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Failure to comply with the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.82,0:45:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能会被驱逐 - 你滚边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- may result in banishment. - You can fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.30,0:45:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得你来之前在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you remember where you were before you came here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.97,0:45:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记不得 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.00,0:45:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.72,0:45:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我为什么记不得 - 这是测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why can't I think of that? - It's a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.08,0:45:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得我们在一起的第一晚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember the first night that we were together?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.13,0:45:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那第一晚 你有什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean the first night. How did you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.87,0:45:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉安全 开心 舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt safe, happy, comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.86,0:45:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.20,0:46:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉有什么正合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt like something locked into place, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.70,0:46:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是我们认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}like we'd met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.20,0:46:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉似曾相识 还会再发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it had happened before and it'll happen again,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.23,0:46:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好像已经发生了数千次\N{\fnArial\fs30}like it's happened a thousand times over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.35,0:46:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你明白我的意思吗 - 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know what I mean? - Yeah. Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.77,0:46:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我们认识 这世界就在玩弄我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since we've met, this world has been toying with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.36,0:46:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,想拆散我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's trying to keep us apart. It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.63,0:46:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个测试 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a test, I swear it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.18,0:46:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要一起反叛它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the two of us rebelling together.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.17,0:46:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能通过测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}is something to do with passing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.49,0:46:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得推翻一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gotta fuck it all off.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.77,0:46:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们要推翻一切规则 逃离这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. We've just gotta fuck the whole thing off and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.50,0:46:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 去翻墙 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, over the wall. - Right over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.52,0:46:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不管外面是什么 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No matter what's out there. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.48,0:46:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.95,0:46:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.24,0:48:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
